{"componentChunkName":"component---src-layouts-designer-layout-tsx","path":"/designers/zavana-couture/","result":{"data":{"strapiDesigner":{"id":"73e8f99b-10a8-53cd-b627-878ba64f0e0c","strapi_id":41,"ShortDescription":"Designed in Australia, Zavana Bridal is for the bride who loves the details–delicate lace, soft textures , and silhouettes designed to flatter and sculpt. ","PriceRangeLow":"200000","PriceRangeHigh":"300000","Name":"ZAVANA COUTURE","LongDescription":[{"children":[{"text":"Zavana Couture is made for the bride who wants to make an entrance. Each gown is thoughtfully crafted using luxurious European laces and intricate hand-placed beading, resulting in silhouettes that shimmer, sculpt, and steal the moment. Zavana Couture has since grown into a globally celebrated label, creating looks for brides around the world who aren't afraid to be unforgettable. Every detail is intentional–from the artistry of the embellishment, to the precision of the fit, showcasing couture craftsmanship in its most captivating form. "}]}],"ImageDesktop":[{"localFile":{"childImageSharp":{"gatsbyImageData":{"layout":"constrained","backgroundColor":"#786858","images":{"fallback":{"src":"/static/27dfc39ff80442c3510b22e3b5ccaa50/f82b3/zavana_desktop_f4e694168f.jpg","srcSet":"/static/27dfc39ff80442c3510b22e3b5ccaa50/4a8fe/zavana_desktop_f4e694168f.jpg 347w,\n/static/27dfc39ff80442c3510b22e3b5ccaa50/61312/zavana_desktop_f4e694168f.jpg 695w,\n/static/27dfc39ff80442c3510b22e3b5ccaa50/f82b3/zavana_desktop_f4e694168f.jpg 1389w","sizes":"(min-width: 1389px) 1389px, 100vw"},"sources":[{"srcSet":"/static/27dfc39ff80442c3510b22e3b5ccaa50/35e06/zavana_desktop_f4e694168f.webp 347w,\n/static/27dfc39ff80442c3510b22e3b5ccaa50/a9197/zavana_desktop_f4e694168f.webp 695w,\n/static/27dfc39ff80442c3510b22e3b5ccaa50/ced33/zavana_desktop_f4e694168f.webp 1389w","type":"image/webp","sizes":"(min-width: 1389px) 1389px, 100vw"}]},"width":1440,"height":751.6198704103672}}}}],"ImageMobile":{"localFile":{"childIm